{"title": "[花邊] 勇士拒絕支付Porzingis薪水", "author": "EZ78 (EZ78)", "board": "", "date": "Wed Nov  4 23:43:57 2026", "url": "https://www.ptt.cc/bbs/NBA/M.1793807039.A.863.html", "body": "https://x.com/ShamsCharania/status/2118005429468827713\n\nThe Warriors are not delivering payments to Kristaps Porzingis on his $20\nmillion salary, ruling that he is not rendering services, sources tell me and\n@anthonyVslater. Golden State is permitted to move his contract at any point\nbefore the Feb. 11 deadline even without paying him currently, and will\ncontinue exhausting trade avenues as the 31-year-old leans toward ending his\nNBA career.\n\nAbsorbing Porzingis' near-expiring deal would allow a rival team to move a\nsalary out and save money and clear a roster spot via a buyout.\n\n勇士拒絕支付Kristaps Porzingis他的20M薪水，聲稱他並沒有提供服務。勇士在2/11的交\n易大限前任何時間交易掉他並用盡這名31歲可能傾向退休的球員的剩餘價值。\n\n吸收Porzingis即將到期的合約將允許一支對家球隊清出薪水、節省支出，並透過買斷騰出\n球員名單名額。\n\n你不打球 那我也不付錢了\n(但大部分球隊都會認賠讓保險公司付就是 上次有印象發生類似的事情應該是洋基跟\nJacoby Ellsbury之類的)", "comments": [{"tag": "推", "user": "bm1041644", "content": "氣氛不對了", "time": "11/04 23:44"}, {"tag": "推", "user": "Tonyx599026", "content": "任意引退（x", "time": "11/04 23:44"}, {"tag": "推", "user": "Yc424", "content": "看來是真的要退休了吧", "time": "11/04 23:44"}, {"tag": "推", "user": "cysticercus", "content": "真的笑死XD", "time": "11/04 23:44"}, {"tag": "推", "user": "a0939877325", "content": "讚", "time": "11/04 23:45"}, {"tag": "推", "user": "wpd", "content": "球員工會要出來了吧", "time": "11/04 23:45"}, {"tag": "→", "user": "jim12441", "content": "球員工會很硬捏要確欸", "time": "11/04 23:45"}, {"tag": "推", "user": "ooxxman", "content": "KP真的滿誇張的，以前簽約了就能戲都不演了領錢退休", "time": "11/04 23:45"}, {"tag": "推", "user": "axi", "content": "互相傷害@@", "time": "11/04 23:45"}, {"tag": "推", "user": "seemoon2000", "content": "勇士現在每季沒點抓馬感覺就是不太對勁", "time": "11/04 23:46"}, {"tag": "推", "user": "ramirez", "content": "挖 來硬的了", "time": "11/04 23:46"}, {"tag": "→", "user": "ooxxman", "content": "勇士老闆有錢也不能被當傻子騙錢，人完全消失還付錢", "time": "11/04 23:4